<h2 style="margin-top:0;">You're invited to OneChat AI 🚀</h2>

<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  <strong><%= inviterName %></strong> has invited you to join their team on
  <strong>OneChat AI</strong>.
</p>

<p>
  OneChat AI helps teams collaborate using AI-powered tools.
</p>

<div style="text-align:center; margin:30px 0;">
  <a href="<%= inviteLink %>"
     style="background:#000; color:#fff; padding:12px 28px;
     text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:bold;">
    Accept Invitation
  </a>
</div>

<p>
  If you don’t already have an account, one will be created for you automatically.
</p>

<p style="font-size:14px; color:#666;">
  If you were not expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>

<p>
  Best regards,<br />
  <strong>OneChat AI Team</strong>
</p>
